      "id": "s16",
      "type": "STICKY_NOTE",
      "transition": "slide",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "The second card for your wall. Assert checks once. Expect re-checks for five seconds. The critic checks twice, and fifty more times, before ever writing a bad review.",
      "data": {
