              "text": "AssertionError: Locator expected to have text",
              "color": "red"
            },
            {
              "text": "'Welcome, Neo'",
              "color": "red"
            },
            {
              "text": "Actual value: Welcome, Trinity",
              "color": "orange"
            },
            {
              "text": "Call log:"
            },
            {
              "text": "  - expect.to_have_text with timeout 5000ms"
            },
            {
