    {
      "id": "s23",
      "type": "LIST_BUILD",
      "transition": "slide",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Train yourself to read every failure the same way, calmly, top to bottom. What did the critic expect. What did it actually find. What does the call log say it tried. The bug is almost always sitting right there.",
      "data": {
        "heading": "Reading any failure, top to bottom",
        "items": [
